OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAbby Norton hosts at Newchester
OL,7,     FFarmhouse B&B in Merriott,
OL,8,     FSomerset. The superstar beds and
OL,9,     Flacklustre linen receive mixed
OL,10,     Freactions, but all the guests are
OL,11,     Fwowed by Abby's hospitality.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FCollette and Danny hope to impress
OL,14,     Ftheir rivals at The Quay Inn in
OL,15,     FMinehead, Somerset. But will
OL,16,     Fcleanliness concerns, a damaged
OL,17,     Fbath panel and sausage squabbles
OL,18,     Fscupper their chances?
